# Environment Configuration for Movie Watchlist Frontend

## API Endpoints

### Production
MOVIE_SERVICE=https://joan.tugastst.my.id
WATCHLIST_SERVICE=http://100.114.117.49:9595

### Development (if you have local instances)
# MOVIE_SERVICE=http://localhost:8010
# WATCHLIST_SERVICE=http://localhost:9595

## Domain Configuration

DOMAIN=huga.tugastst.my.id

## SSL Certificate Paths (for production deployment)

SSL_CERT_PATH=/etc/letsencrypt/live/huga.tugastst.my.id/fullchain.pem
SSL_KEY_PATH=/etc/letsencrypt/live/huga.tugastst.my.id/privkey.pem

## Docker Configuration

CONTAINER_NAME=huga-frontend
HTTP_PORT=80
HTTPS_PORT=443

## Notes:

1. Update app.js API_CONFIG if you change the API endpoints
2. SSL certificates are required for HTTPS deployment
3. Make sure both microservices are running before deploying frontend
4. For local development, you can use http-server or python's SimpleHTTPServer
